#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:419
msgid "User deregistration"
msgstr "Benutzer-Abmeldung"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:421
msgid ""
"The :program:`Self Service` allows users to request the deletion of their"
" user account."
msgstr ""
"Der :program:`Self Service` ermöglicht es Benutzern, die Löschung ihres "
"Benutzerkontos anzufordern."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:427
msgid "Deregistration request"
msgstr "Anfrage zur Abmeldung"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:429
msgid ""
"If a user requests to delete their account, Nubus doesn't delete the user"
" account directly, but deactivates it. If the user has a "
"``PasswordRecoveryEmail`` defined, Nubus sends a notification email. In "
"addition, Nubus sets the following attributes of the user account:"
msgstr ""
"Wenn ein Benutzer die Löschung seines Kontos anfordert, löscht Nubus das "
"Benutzerkonto nicht direkt, sondern deaktiviert es. Wenn der Benutzer "
"eine ``PasswordRecoveryEmail`` definiert hat, benachrichtigt Nubus den "
"Benutzer über E-Mail. Zusätzlich setzt Nubus die folgenden Attribute des "
"Benutzerkontos:"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:437
msgid "``DeregisteredThroughSelfService`` to ``TRUE``"
msgstr "``DeregisteredThroughSelfService`` auf ``TRUE``"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:438
msgid ""
"``DeregistrationTimestamp`` to the current time in the `GeneralizedTime "
"LDAP syntax <ldap-generalized-time_>`_."
msgstr ""
"``DeregistrationTimestamp`` zur aktuellen Zeit in der `GeneralizedTime "
"LDAP-Syntax <ldap-generalized-time_>`_."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:440
msgid "Use the following UCR variables to configure user self-deregistration."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie die folgenden UCR-Variablen, um die Abmeldung des eigenen Kontos durch Benutzer "
"zu konfigurieren."

