#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:483
msgid "Account cleanup"
msgstr "Konto-Bereinigung"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:485
msgid ""
"The *Self Service* provides a script at :file:`/usr/share/univention-"
"self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py` that you can use to delete "
"all ``users/user`` objects that have the "
"``DeregisteredThroughSelfService`` attribute set to ``TRUE`` and whose "
"``DeregistrationTimestamp`` attribute is older than a specified time."
msgstr ""
"Der *Self Service* bietet ein Skript unter :file:`/usr/share/univention-"
"self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py`, das Sie verwenden können, "
"um alle ``users/user``-Objekte zu löschen, bei denen das Attribut "
"``DeregisteredThroughSelfService`` auf ``TRUE`` gesetzt ist und deren "
"Attribut ``DeregistrationTimestamp`` älter als eine angegebene Zeit ist."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:495
msgid "Manually delete de-registered user accounts"
msgstr "Manuell abgemeldete Benutzerkonten löschen"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:496
msgid ""
"The command in :numref:`end-user-self-service-deregistration-delete-"
"listing` deletes user accounts whose ``DeregistrationTimestamp`` is older"
" than 5 days and 2 hours."
msgstr ""
"Der Befehl in :numref:`end-user-self-service-deregistration-delete-"
"listing` löscht Benutzerkonten, deren ``DeregistrationTimestamp`` älter "
"als 5 Tage und 2 Stunden ist."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:499
msgid "Example for deleting de-registered and deactivated user accounts"
msgstr "Beispiel zum Löschen abgemeldeter und deaktivierter Benutzerkonten"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:499
msgid ""
"$ /usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py \\\n"
"  --timedelta-days 5 \\\n"
"  --timedelta-hours 2"
msgstr ""
"$ /usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py \\\n"
"  --timedelta-days 5 \\\n"
"  --timedelta-hours 2"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:509
msgid "Script arguments"
msgstr "Skript-Argumente"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:510
msgid ""
"For the possible arguments of the script, see :numref:`end-user-self-"
"service-deregistration-script-arguments-listing`."
msgstr ""
"Für die möglichen Argumente des Skripts siehe :numref:`end-user-self-"
"service-deregistration-script-arguments-listing`."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:513
