msgstr "Verfügbare Argumente für :file:`delete_deregistered_accounts.py`"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:513
msgid ""
"$ /usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py "
"--help"
msgstr ""
"$ /usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py "
"--help"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:521
msgid "Scheduled deletion of de-registered user accounts"
msgstr "Geplante Löschung abgemeldeter Benutzerkonten"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:522
msgid ""
"You can schedule the script to run regularly. Create a cron job through a"
" UCR variable, as shown in :numref:`end-user-self-service-deregistration-"
"schedule-listing`."
msgstr ""
"Sie können das Skript so planen, dass es regelmäßig läuft. Erstellen Sie "
"einen Cron-Job über eine UCR-Variable, wie in :numref:`end-user-self-"
"service-deregistration-schedule-listing` gezeigt."

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:526
msgid "Schedule deletion of de-registered user accounts"
msgstr "Planen Sie die Löschung abgemeldeter Benutzerkonten"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:526
msgid ""
"$ ucr set cron/delete_deregistered_accounts/command=\\\n"
"/usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py\\\n"
"' --timedelta-days 30'\\\n"
"  cron/delete_deregistered_accounts/time='00 06 * * *'  # daily at 06:00"
msgstr ""
"$ ucr set cron/delete_deregistered_accounts/command=\\\n"
"/usr/share/univention-self-service/delete_deregistered_accounts.py\\\n"
"' --timedelta-days 30'\\\n"
"  cron/delete_deregistered_accounts/time='00 06 * * *'  # täglich um 06:00"

#: ../../iam/password-management/user-self-service.rst:535
msgid ""
"For more information about how to set cron jobs through UCR variables, "
"see :external+uv-ucs-manual:ref:`computers-defining-cron-jobs-in-"
"univention-configuration-registry`."
msgstr ""
"Für weitere Informationen zum Einrichten von Cron-Jobs über UCR-Variablen"
" siehe :external+uv-ucs-manual:ref:`computers-defining-cron-jobs-in-"
"univention-configuration-registry`."

